@tracker-import
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ P2 · from source ado · 5m ago                             │
│ AB#4812 User Story · "Export audit log as CSV"            │
│ assigned to you · sprint 42 · 3 child tasks               │
│                                                           │
│ Proposed: roadmap item + 3 tasks in phase p9-audit        │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ a apply · x drop · o open in ADO · s ask Claude to plan it│
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: a source plugin's import is a pending proposal like any other. Nothing
reaches the gameplan until the owner applies it.

@reflection-proposal
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Q2 · weekly reflection 2026-W41 · Momus: supported        │
│ Self model · new behavior entry                           │
│ "Re-reads a file after editing it when a diff             │
│  would do" [s:3f2a… d:tools.Read.rereads]                 │
│                                                           │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ a apply · x drop · r read the report · s ask Claude       │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: reflect pending apply|drop. Stances apply one at a time; 'apply all' skips them.

@ariadne-review
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Ariadne · diff from worker 2 · not verified               │
│ Package: palace import resolution (T-e23)                 │
│ Why: selected tests ran nothing (skip-only suite)         │
│ require_tests is on, so this went to review               │
│                                                           │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ d diff · t test log · s ask Claude to review it           │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: from #38: a diff whose tests executed nothing is never verified.

@gameplan-proposal
┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ P1 · from the capture hook · 10m ago                      │
│ T-e5  in_progress → done                                  │
│ resolution: local backends merged (PR #36)                │
│                                                           │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ a apply · x drop · s ask Claude to check it first         │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
note: a/x call `daedalus gameplan pending apply|drop`. The only direct write in v1.

note (v1 as built, edict 0012): drop is `x` (and `d` on a proposal; on a PR `d` shows the
diff stat). `o` (open in a browser) is not built in v1. The edict detail shows the Intent
section; `r` shows the whole edict. PRs, edicts and dissents have no merge, accept or resolve
key: pressing `a` or `x` on one says where that decision is made.
